<p>There's no fake preview here — this is a real <code>@media print</code> stylesheet, already loaded on this exact page. Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd> (<kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd> on a Mac) right now, or open Print Preview, to see it applied for real:</p>
<ul class="print-demo-list">
